For a commutator machine with 6 poles and 40 coils, determine for a simplex lap winding—
(i) the number of commutator segments;
(ii) back pitch and front pitch;
(iii) commutator pitch.

Discuss how the parallel operation of two single-phase transformers is affected by—
(i) unequal voltage ratio;
(ii) unequal per unit leakage impedances but same $x_e / r_e$ ratio.
